//! Quests: what townsfolk ask of characters, generated by the server from
//! each town's seed so they are the same for everyone (`docs/context/quests.md`).
//!
//! The model (`Quest`, its `Step` graph, `Requirement`s, rewards) and the
//! generator: a town's givers and their slots, the pois near it, a template
//! by what each poi offers (`Hook`), and the quest's story through
//! `shared::story`. Each poi's boss, item and lost one belong to one town's
//! quest alone (`owner`), so quests never overlap. Only the server calls the
//! generator: pois' seeds are secret.

